## Socratic AI
An android app powered by State-of-the-Art agentic framework with a 2B parameter Gemma 4 multimodal model specifically finetuned
to be a socratic tutor instead of a prompt answering chatbot. The 2B model uses Google LiteRT technology to ensure that the model
can run locally on mobile phones without internet access. The agentic framework includes a sophisticated pipeline for processing
user uploaded documents including PDFs and Handwriten notebook images and a hybrid RAG system for searhcing this database.